Subject: [PATCH 11/12] feat(desktop): add useAgent and useRunEvents v3 hooks
 with data index

Implement agent loop state hook and event streaming hook supporting
runs.subscribe, resync on gaps/resync_required, reconnect with backoff,
and unmount unsubscribe. Export all 21 data hooks from index.ts.
